outlooks.projected:
Mixed, and the timing has moved from distant to immediate.

Stage-1 qualification on PrivatBank's cash-recycler programme closed on 25/08/2026. The portal stamps the qualification window as 08/04/2026 15:00 to 25/08/2026 08:48 Kyiv time. The record now sits in the stage-2 waiting state, with no published budget ([tender.privatbank.ua PB-2026-03-17-3068329](https://tender.privatbank.ua/commercial/tender/PB-2026-03-17-3068329)).

The specification is confirmed word for word on a Diebold Nixdorf software baseline:
- extended module statuses for the DN Vynamic View monitoring handler;
- full compatibility with DN ProFlex 4.x and VCP Pro 7 across the recycler, card reader, NFC reader and encrypting PIN pad;
- licensed Windows 11 64-bit LTSC with CEN/XFS 3.50;
- at least four recycling denominations at the same time;
- five currencies including hryvnia, dollar and euro;
- Worldline processing support;
- a two-year warranty including parts;
- all adaptation at the vendor's own cost.

Preparation for a fleet replacement is visible around it. The bank ordered technical-condition acts (inspection reports) and defect schedules on its ATMs and self-service terminals in August 2026 (UA-2026-08-03-004344-a, awarded 03/08/2026). An independent check of all 125 of its notices under the ATM parts code found no whole-machine purchase dated 2026 at all ([A1](findings/01-bank-disclosures/2026-08-27.md)).

Two pieces of context belong in any account plan here, and neither is settled. The previous recycler supply covered 1,140 NCR machines, 800 lobby and 340 through-the-wall, for UAH 838,639,173.73 including VAT. That contract was signed 16/01/2025 with a 24-month warranty, which puts the end of warranty and the managed-service renewal at around November 2027 rather than this year ([Prozorro UA-2025-01-17-010779-a](https://public-api.prozorro.gov.ua/api/2.5/tenders/91535417b84240648f1dabd4a3fd1e22)).

The bank's parallel two-pocket banknote-sorter round carries EUR 1,538,156.59 including VAT across two lots and went to electronic auction on 28/08/2026. Its published stage-1 list names four firms: Glory Global Solutions bidding directly, Bankivski Tekhnolohii, DIIP 2000 and I.B.S. ([tender.privatbank.ua PB-2026-08-20-3072069](https://tender.privatbank.ua/commercial/tender/PB-2026-08-20-3072069)).

Where to aim:
- The stage-2 commercial round at PrivatBank.
- The supplier-registration and stage-1 qualification process at the same bank, which governs both this programme and the sorter contest.
- Certification against ProFlex 4.x, VCP Pro 7 and Vynamic View, or a formal challenge to that clause before stage two closes.
- Second-line maintenance of the bank's non-NCR Diebold Nixdorf recycler estate, as the cheap related service reference. The market has turned it down twice and no third attempt has appeared in five months ([tender.privatbank.ua PB-2026-03-25-3068553](https://tender.privatbank.ua/commercial/tender/PB-2026-03-25-3068553)).

In short: settle the qualification gate and the software-baseline question first. On this procurement they decide who takes part before anyone gets to price.
